# SPA fallback: this is a client-routed single-page app, so every path has to
# be served index.html and let react-router resolve it. Without this, a hard
# refresh (or a shared link) on /courses/chess returns a real 404 from the host.
#
# Format read by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages. Vercel uses vercel.json instead
# (also in this repo). Other hosts:
#   - Firebase Hosting: "rewrites": [{ "source": "**", "destination": "/index.html" }]
#   - nginx:            try_files $uri /index.html;
#   - Apache:           FallbackResource /index.html
/*    /index.html   200
